    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with friends in this action-packed roguelite where every run is a new adventure. Battle through waves of enemies, conquer unique challenges, and collect powerful loot to strengthen your character. The more you play, the stronger you become \u2014 unlocking new gear, abilities, and strategies to survive increasingly difficult and rewarding maps. The real test begins when the difficulty ramps up... are you and your team ready?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with friends in this action-packed roguelite where every run is a new adventure. Battle through waves of enemies, conquer unique challenges, and collect powerful loot to strengthen your character. The more you play, the stronger you become \u2014 unlocking new gear, abilities, and strategies to survive increasingly difficult and rewarding maps. The real test begins when the difficulty ramps up... are you and your team ready?</p>",
    "short_description": "Team up with friends in a roguelite adventure! Fight enemies, collect loot, and power up your character to take on harder maps. Each run is unique, and the stronger you get, the deeper the challenge goes. How far can your team go?",
